# <type>[(<scope>)][!]: imperative subject, lowercase, <= 50 target, 72 hard, no period
# types:  feat fix refactor docs test build ci chore revert
# scopes: logger composition gameapi presentation pipeline tests build docs repo
#         (optional; commits spanning several scopes, or touching none, stay scopeless)
# fix requires a body: Cause / Fix / Ruled out / Verification; other bodies optional
# wrap body at 72; breaking change: '!' before ':' and/or a BREAKING CHANGE: footer
# no attribution trailers; release notes come from git-cliff reading these messages
